      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FEARFULL DRAGON NZ (3) made it two on the trot last start when he got the cash by 4.5 metres over 1800m at Globe Derby Park. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Steps up a level but he is capable of running another bold race. SPORTSFLIGHT (6) put together some minor placings then displayed pleasing improvement last start to score by 1.5 metres over 1609m at this track on September 8. That latest effort is good enough to win a race of this calibre. GRUMPYPANTS GRACIE (2) should be at her peak for this. Finished sixth over 1800m at Globe Derby Park at the latest appearance nine days ago. Sure to give the top fancies plenty to think about. ROLL WITH MUSTARD (1) is worth plenty of thought off a last-start win by 10 metres at this track over 1609m.",
